Package:      https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/Microsoft.Online.SharePoint.PowerShell
Upstream:     https://github.com/Azure/azure-powershell/blob/preview/LICENSE.txt

This package is a required runtime dependency. The native shim
(src/SPOService.CrossPlatform/HttpClientExecutor.cs) references the
Microsoft.SharePoint.Client.WebRequestExecutor type from
Microsoft.SharePoint.Client.Runtime.dll, which ships with
Microsoft.Online.SharePoint.PowerShell. The reference is binary-only and
resolved from the user's installed module (see csproj: <Private>false</Private>).
The PowerShell side uses reflection to bind to internal types (CmdLetContext,
SPOService, SPOServiceHelper) by name.

